            <description><![CDATA[<p class="jarvis-headline">A meeting that didn't record no longer warns on your day.</p>
<h2>Jarvis 0.20.34</h2>
<ul>
  <li>If a meeting fails to record, the warning now shows only on that meeting in Meetings, not on the Meetings button on your Focus screen.</li>
  <li>The Meetings button still warns when microphone or system audio access is off, since that would stop the next recording.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
